liye, Remote Signed ke saath chalao.

1256
01:16:07,353 --> 01:16:12,433
Aur text ajeeb characters mein aaye, toh
dhyaan do ki har read aur write utf eight

1257
01:16:12,433 --> 01:16:13,177
ke saath ho.

1258
01:16:14,477 --> 01:16:15,771
Interview corner.

1259
01:16:15,991 --> 01:16:21,386
Pehla question: CLI ko sirf error
print karne ki jagah exit code kyun lautaana

1260
01:16:21,386 --> 01:16:21,939
chahiye?

1261
01:16:24,289 --> 01:16:29,889
Answer: scripts, CI, aur doosre programs
aapke sentences nahi padh sakte, lekin exit

1262
01:16:29,889 --> 01:16:31,289
code padh sakte hain.

1263
01:16:31,509 --> 01:16:33,555
Zero success, baaki failure.

1264
01:16:33,775 --> 01:16:36,660
Do ampersand aur CI
steps isi se rukte hain.

1265
01:16:36,880 --> 01:16:41,011
Trap: Error print karna aur
phir bhi zero ke saath exit karna.

1266
01:16:41,231 --> 01:16:43,966
Pipeline khushi
khushi aage chalti rehti hai.

1267
01:16:44,316 --> 01:16:48,465
Doosra: HTTP requests wale
code ko test kaise karte ho?

1268
01:16:50,815 --> 01:16:56,140
Answer: network ki jagah ek fake
lagao. httpx MockTransport pehle se tayyar

1269
01:16:56,140 --> 01:16:59,975
responses deta hai, four
zero four jaise errors samet.

1270
01:17:00,195 --> 01:17:03,645
Tests tez aur repeatable
bante hain, bina asli server ke.

1271
01:17:03,865 --> 01:17:06,522
Trap: tests mein asli API call karna.

1272
01:17:06,742 --> 01:17:10,391
Slow, kabhi pass kabhi fail,
aur paise ya keys ka nuksaan.

1273
01:17:10,741 --> 01:17:14,258
Teesra: calculation aur
formatting ko alag kyun rakhte hain?

1274
01:17:16,608 --> 01:17:22,644
Answer: har hissa akele test ho sakta
hai, aur naya output, jaise JSON, CSV, ya web

1275
01:17:22,644 --> 01:17:25,480
page, ganit ko chhue bina jod sakte ho.

1276
01:17:25,700 --> 01:17:28,360
Yahi single responsibility ka idea hai.

1277
01:17:28,580 --> 01:17:33,266
Trap: ek bahut bada function jo load
bhi kare, calculate bhi, aur print bhi.

1278
01:17:33,486 --> 01:17:35,721
Na test ho sakta hai, na reuse.

1279
01:17:37,021 --> 01:17:38,241
Module recap.

1280
01:17:38,461 --> 01:17:43,123
Aapne lists, dictionaries, aur sets
use kiye, aur conversations ko message

1281
01:17:43,123 --> 01:17:45,455
dictionaries ki list ki tarah banaya.

1282
01:17:45,805 --> 01:17:48,997
Functions, dataclasses,
aur apni exceptions likhi.

1283
01:17:49,347 --> 01:17:54,809
Package organise kiya, aur files,
JSON, aur environment variables ke saath kaam

1284
01:17:54,809 --> 01:17:55,155
kiya.

1285
01:17:55,505 --> 01:18:00,251
Type hints lagaye, HTTP requests
ki, aur downloads ek saath chalaye.

1286
01:18:00,601 --> 01:18:05,762
Aur ek tested command line tool banaya,
saaf errors aur sahi exit codes ke saath.

1287
01:18:07,062 --> 01:18:09,012
Module quiz, pehla sawaal.

1288
01:18:09,232 --> 01:18:12,141
Ek agent sirf do tools use kar sakta hai.

1289
01:18:12,361 --> 01:18:16,924
Tool allowed hai ya nahi, iska
sabse tez check kaunsa structure deta hai?

1290
01:18:22,624 --> 01:18:23,508
B, set.

1291
01:18:23,728 --> 01:18:27,117
Set kitna bhi bada ho,
membership check tez rehta hai.

1292
01:18:28,417 --> 01:18:33,432
Doosra sawaal. frozen equals True
hamare usage record mein kya jodta hai?

1293
01:18:39,132 --> 01:18:39,617
C.

1294
01:18:39,837 --> 01:18:43,065
Record banne ke baad
fields badli nahi ja sakti.

1295
01:18:43,285 --> 01:18:46,802
Aur yaad rahe, dataclass
khud types validate nahi karti.

1296
01:18:47,022 --> 01:18:49,493
Isliye from dict har
field check karta hai.

1297
01:18:50,793 --> 01:18:51,981
Teesra sawaal.

1298
01:18:52,201 --> 01:18:54,322
Ek command error print karti hai.

1299
01:18:54,542 --> 01:18:57,946
CI pipeline ko kaise pata
chalta hai ki woh fail hui?

1300
01:19:03,646 --> 01:19:05,573
B, non zero exit code se.

1301
01:19:05,793 --> 01:19:09,729
Hamara validate kisi bhi
invalid record par ek lautaata hai.

1302
01:19:11,029 --> 01:19:15,120
Chautha sawaal. fetch all
asyncio dot gather kyun use karta hai?

1303
01:19:20,820 --> 01:19:21,323
B.

1304
01:19:21,543 --> 01:19:27,178
Taaki sab ek saath download ho, aur total
time lagbhag sabse slow download jitna ho,

1305
01:19:27,178 --> 01:19:28,184
sabka jod nahi.

1306
01:19:29,484 --> 01:19:30,854
Aur paanchva sawaal.

1307
01:19:31,074 --> 01:19:34,215
Project ki asli API
key kahan rehni chahiye?

1308
01:19:39,915 --> 01:19:40,399
C.

1309
01:19:40,619 --> 01:19:44,481
Environment variable mein, ya
git ignored dot env file mein.

1310
01:19:44,701 --> 01:19:47,558
Example file mein
hamesha sirf fake values.

1311
01:19:48,858 --> 01:19:51,811
Aage jaana hai, toh yeh
raha extension challenge.

1312
01:19:52,031 --> 01:19:56,136
Ek ya zyaada chuno, aur har ek
ke liye code aur test dono likho.

1313
01:19:56,486 --> 01:19:58,925
report command mein top N option jodo.

1314
01:19:59,275 --> 01:20:01,328
p ninety five latency jodo.

1315
01:20:01,548 --> 01:20:04,842
Average ki tarah yeh ek
slow request se bigadti nahi.

1316
01:20:05,192 --> 01:20:08,271
created at timestamp se
har din ka breakdown jodo.

1317
01:20:08,621 --> 01:20:12,719
Ya standard csv module
se CSV output format jodo.

1318
01:20:14,019 --> 01:20:18,556
Yeh hamari use ki hui har cheez
ke official documentation pages hain.

1319
01:20:18,776 --> 01:20:22,936
Links description mein hain, aur
poora source code course repository mein.

1320
01:20:27,036 --> 01:20:28,657
Module ek complete.

1321
01:20:28,877 --> 01:20:33,495
Ab aapke paas woh Python foundation
hai jis par yeh poora course khada hai.

1322
01:20:33,715 --> 01:20:38,777
Module do mein aap aakhirkaar
language model se baat karoge: tokens, context

1323
01:20:38,777 --> 01:20:43,306
windows, message history,
structured output, rate limits, aur costs.

1324
01:20:43,526 --> 01:20:46,050
Aur ek AI Study Assistant banaoge.

1325
01:20:46,270 --> 01:20:47,466
Milte hain wahan.
